<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis AG to make 1-for-12 rights issue.</title>
<headline>Fortis AG to make 1-for-12 rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-Belgian financial group Fortis said on Friday its Belgian parent company Fortis AG planned to make a one-for-12 rights issue.  </p>
<p>The issue price will be announced on February 11. Subscriptions will be open from February 12 to 26.</p>
<p>Fortis said some 38.49 million Fortis AG shares were eligible for the rights issue and that some 3.2 million new shares would be issued.</p>
<p>Fortis AG announced plans in mid-January for a rights issue in connection with Fortis's 2.5 billion guilder acquisition of Dutch investment bank MeesPierson from ABN AMRO.</p>
<p>The exact ratio of the issue had not previously been disclosed but analysts had expected one-for-10 or one-for-nine.</p>
